cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the released SDG interaction matrix, please cite the paper below."
title: "Neighbours and Graphs: LLM-Based SDG Classification of Research Abstracts"
abstract: >-
  Code, SDG-SDG interaction matrices, and raw LLM predictions for a controlled
  comparison of label-graph propagation against per-document retrieval
  post-corrections for multi-label SDG classification of research abstracts.
